      "note": [
        "The table refers to the number of migrations and not the number of persons that have changed residence during the year. During a year a person can change residence more than once.",
        "Districts is a geographic division of Sweden consisting of 2,523 areas that are introduced in the civil registry database 1 January 2016 when the civil registration will no longer take place on parishes. The district concept is based on an adjusted version of the parishes in force on 31 December 1999."
      ],
